\\qquad\n    Z_t=\\frac{\\V(f_t)}{Q_t}.\n\\]", "Separator" -> 
     "\n"|>|>,ExpressionUUID->"9b03580f-a65b-da1f-40ea-441d4729bd88"],

Cell[TextData[{
