  ExpressionUUID->"553f1e1e-f884-9486-bb2d-872609f93567"],
 " is a nonnegative supermartingale.  This gives the\nfirst displayed bound.  \
The second follows from"
}], "Proof",
 CellDingbat->None,
 TaggingRules-><|"MathNotebook" -> <|"Separator" -> "\n"|>|>,
