  ExpressionUUID->"3e4ca148-1ed8-bae7-a80e-44d77d27b0ba"],
 ".  Low-frequency\nenergy can increase even while variance decreases; the \
next moment involves\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["L", "G", "2"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  TaggingRules-><|"MathNotebook" -> <|"SourceTeX" -> "L_G^2"|>|>,
  ExpressionUUID->"77a2eb9c-1810-8e36-3d52-d22c33b2ba9b"],
 " and exposes the carrier--field alignment problem."
}], "Text",
