14&I-P_A&.000&.018&.034&.046&.050&.056\\\\\n \
&I-P_B&.000&.021&.045&.066&.070&.080\\\\\n &L_{\\rm \
supp}&.000&.332&.706&.788&.862&1.116\n\\end{array}\n\\]", "Separator" -> 
     "\n"|>|>,ExpressionUUID->"2f4cb55a-bed6-76ad-3794-9f4c8a226af2"],

Cell["\<\
These values are consistent with the proved upper bounds on fixed-index
normalized eigenvalues.  They do not prove a matching lower bound.\
\>", "Text",
 TaggingRules-><|
  "MathNotebook" -> <|
    "Separator" -> 
     "\n\n"|>|>,ExpressionUUID->"19ded983-4bea-44b1-9916-50fcfb38c03d"],

