    "EnvironmentOpen" -> "    \\item ", "Separator" -> 
     "\n"|>|>,ExpressionUUID->"ad2dc88c-8426-584e-1b04-47f5753f75a4"],

Cell["\<\
identity, composition, and inverse laws for pullback by an explicit
    coordinate permutation, including exact conjugacy between relabelling and
    pair averaging;\
\>", "Item",
 TaggingRules-><|
  "MathNotebook" -> <|
    "EnvironmentOpen" -> "    \\item ", "Separator" -> 
     "\n"|>|>,ExpressionUUID->"353beb99-d51c-07f6-1ca7-e9e987fbac60"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "preservation of total mass, commutation and idempotence of the block\n    \
schedules, and exact consensus for the two transverse ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["K", "4"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
